[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.38]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.62]I never got their name until the credits
[00:13.22]now it plays here every single day
[00:19.30]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:21.70]One note at a time
[00:27.90]from people passing through
[00:32.24]a name beside a line
[00:37.74]and part of it is you
[00:47.60]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
